      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Independent Calgary builders quote the slab, framing, roof, doors and electrical as one job. Here is what a typical back-lane garage includes and how the job runs from site visit to final inspection.</p>
